# PicoScan

Offline OCR app. Layers: **UI → Engine → Core/DB**. Shared engine powers Phase 2 widget.

- Match PicoERP visual tokens (`src/styles/variables.css`).
- Editable document model is the export source of truth.
- No cloud OCR / no backend. Third-party libs live in `vendor/`.
- Serve with `python -m http.server` from repo root.
- Embed host: `widget.html` (no SW) for PicoERP FAB iframe.
- Read root `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
